<title>UK: LIFFE coffee firmer as expected, cocoa, sugar weak.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee firmer as expected, cocoa, sugar weak.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Firmer but below due, May rolling into July ahead of first notice day. July up $10 at $1,610 at 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Slightly weaker as expected, volume thin and ranges tight. July down one at 1,043 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Nearbys touch lower in thin start to session. August down 40 cents at $312.70.</p>
</text>
